      "annotationExplanation": "人名，具体所指待考"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "shanhaijing",
      "chapterIndex": 14,
      "entryId": "shanhaijing-14-11",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "操鸟，方食其头。王亥托于有易、河伯。仆牛，有易杀王亥，取仆牛。河"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "soushenji-04-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "班问：“女郎何在？”曰：“女为河伯妇。”班曰：“辄当奉书，不知缘"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "soushenji-04-04",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "八月上庚日渡河，溺死。天帝署为河伯。又五行书曰：“河伯以庚辰日死"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 4,
      "entryId": "soushenji-04-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "城，进厅事，上有信幡，题云：“河伯信。”俄见一人，年三十许，颜色"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "soushenji",
      "chapterIndex": 11,
      "entryId": "soushenji-11-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "呼，水为逆流三百步。观者皆以为河伯也。"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 2,
      "entryId": "chuci-02-08",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "怅忘归,\n\n惟极浦兮寤怀。\n\n河伯鱼鳞屋兮龙堂,\n\n紫贝阙兮珠宫"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 3,
      "entryId": "chuci-03-03",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "夷羿,\n\n革孽夏民。\n\n胡射夫河伯,\n\n而妻彼雒嫔？\n\n冯珧利决"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "chuci",
      "chapterIndex": 12,
      "entryId": "chuci-12-05",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "旗兮电骛,\n\n倏忽兮容裔。\n\n河伯兮开门,\n\n迎余兮欢欣。\n\n顾"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 17,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-17-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "，生子而牺，尸祝斋戒以沉诸河，河伯岂羞其所从出，辞而不享哉！\n\n"
    },
    {
      "bookId": "huainanzi",
      "chapterIndex": 19,
      "entryId": "huainanzi-19-01",
      "type": "text",
      "context": "有罗纨者必有麻蒯。鸟有沸波者，河伯为之不潮，畏其诚也。故一夫出死"
    }
  ],
  "firstSeen": {
